# Claude Code settings are deliberately NOT synced.
# Claude Code rewrites ~/.claude/settings.json on /login, /config, model and plugin
# changes. Syncing it made devices needing different auth (standard account login vs
# Vercel AI Gateway) overwrite each other. claude/settings.template.json is the
# fresh-machine seed; the live file stays local. Do not re-add these.
claude/settings.json
claude/settings.local.json
